WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.400
How come we stay, Dad?

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:10.220
Heh?

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:11.520
Detroit.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.940
Son, the lion don't leave the Serengeti.

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:16.000
And besides, it'll be our year, I can feel it.

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:21.120
You realize you're the worst father ever!

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.540
I'm not gonna let you ruin your life, Dawn.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:23.460
No drugs in the house!

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:26.840
Dad!

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:28.040
Everything's fine.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:28.860
It's not fine!

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:30.380
You're fine, Ma's fine-

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:31.020
I hate you!

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:31.760
Dawn, you're fine.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:32.860
You're gonna let her talk to you like that?

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:33.900
I'm going to the goddamn house!

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:34.980
Ray, stay out of it.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:36.420
Put some clothes on, will ya?

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:37.780
We're going for custard!

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.100
Y'all know who my dad is right? Y'all know what he saw?

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.720
Hey, I know your broke-ass daddy.

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:47.800
What you said your name was?

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:48.600
Rick.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:49.540
Aight. White Boy Rick.

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:53.420
You got some balls coming here like you did. You should come out by the Skate and Roll sometime.

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.660
But not like this. Look like you robbed a Kmart or something.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:01.920
You're good, Rick. You want to move weight, you come to me.

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:04.780
My dad finds this, he'll kick my ass.

00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:06.180
Well, just make sure he doesn't find it then.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:12.060
Break it down: the dime rocks. Get yourself a crew and I'll float it, and before long people know you're legit.

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:13.120
It's Ricky!

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:13.940
He white!

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:18.400
You're gonna get in too deep. Man, they're not gonna let you out.

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:20.600
You talk, I'll know.

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:27.360
Eight pounds, fourteen ounces.

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:30.040
Such a weight you were born.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:33.720
First time I looked in your eyes, I knew you were gonna be bigger than me.

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:36.440
And that your life was gonna be bigger than mine.

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:39.360
Look at this dad!

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:41.080
Look how we're living!

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:43.180
Let's hustle big.

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:45.720
I know the players, and I know the game!

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:47.660
Hey, come on, Dad!

00:01:47.660 --> 00:01:51.520
I can do this. We can do this. We can fix our lives

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:53.960
and be a family again.

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:57.520
What do you say?

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:17.720
Ask yourself this: would you believe a fifteen-year old kid was working for the federal government?

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:20.540
But he was.

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:24.960
Woah! Shit!

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:25.540
Hey!

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:27.500
What? You all got 'em.

